und (hard reset)</p>\n            <div class='ss-help ss-help-top'>Downloads a fresh copy of Newbound from GitHub and replaces the platform code and core data with it. Your own libraries are kept. Any changes you made to the built-in apps are lost. Rebuilds everything, then asks you to restart.</div>\n            <div class='ss-btn-row'>\n              <button type='button' class='regularbutton ss-btn-danger hard-reset'>Hard Reset</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class='ss-foot card-button-wrap'>\n        <a class=\"regularbutton close-system-settings\">Cancel</a>\n        <a class=\"clearbutton save-system-settings close-system-settings\">Save</a>\n        <a class=\"coloredbutton save-and-restart\">Save and Restart</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>","old":"  <div class='card modal system-settings'>\n    <div class='appinfo-header pad16'>\n      <span>Settings</span>\n       <button class=\"popupcard-close close-system-settings\">\n          <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n       </button>\n    </div>\n    <div class='pad16'>\n      <label class='textinputlabel' for='devicename'>Device Name</label>\n      <input type='text' class='textinput' placeholder='Name of this device' id='devicename'>\n      <br><br>\n      <label class='textinputlabel' for='ipaddr'>IP Address</label>\n      <input type='text' class='textinput' placeholder='IP Address for HTTP' id='ipaddr'>\n      <br><br>\n      <label class='textinputlabel' for='portnum'>Port Number</label>\n      <input type='number' class='textinput' placeholder='Port for HTTP' id='portnum'>\n      <br><br>\n      <label class='textinputlabel' for='defaultbot'>Default App</label>\n      <select name='defaultbot' class=